    "note": "First reader: the bill as filed, January 16, 2019. Also deletes 'prior to application and each renewal,' from the training requirement in 5-306(a)(5) and re-letters subsections. Senate third-reading passage vote is recorded; amendments made after the version read are not in the text read."
